# CSS Flexbox Tutorial

Flexbox makes it easy to design flexible responsive layouts.

## Container Properties

```css
.container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
}
```

## Item Properties

```css
.item {
    flex: 1;
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}
```
